{"pageid": 295, "title": "Something Is Killing the Children 19", "revid": 2282, "categories": ["Comics", "Something Is Killing the Children comics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Something Is Killing the Children #19</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/16/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230226173547\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 19 Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/16/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230226173547\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/16/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230226173547 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/16/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20230226173547 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children 19 Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 19 Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writer\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 25, 2021</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_18\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 18\">Something Is Killing the Children #18</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_20\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 20\">Something Is Killing the Children #20</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #19</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on August 25, 2021 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the nineteenth issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a> must play the Game of Nowhere, a secretive binding ritual of the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a>, but not everyone wants her to succeed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a> is awoken by <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tybalt Slaughter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHliYWx0X1NsYXVnaHRlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Tybalt</span>, who threatens him with a knife, along with his twin brother <span class=\"new\" title=\"Paris Slaughter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGFyaXNfU2xhdWdodGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Paris</span>. Despite Aaron's short attempt to grab the knife, the twins get it back and pin him to the bed, calling him a runt and mocking him for crying. They then mock him for <i>almost</i> having a sister who was sent to die on <a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Big Gary</a>'s farm. Aaron angrily shouts that she is going to live, and that she'd almost killed an Oscuratype the day before. <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia</a> then enters and sends the twins off, before having Aaron get dressed to leave. \n</p><p>In Erica's trance, she relives the moment she decided to fight back against the Oscuratype. She grabs a kitchen knife and attacks it while it eats her father, stabbing it in the eye. She then hears her mother beg her to go to the neighbors and get them to call the police. Erica runs, but stops once outside the house, remembering Aaron and <a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica</a>'s warnings. Erica then turns, speaking directly to the monster and saying that it's trying to trick her, which the ghostly octopus spectre affirms. While it tries to make her leave, saying that the memory will still hurt, Erica knows that any other option wouldn't be real, and it's trying to take away the memory of it losing. She goes inside, accepting that her parents are dead and refusing to listen to the monster's manipulations. \n</p><p>She lays back down under the monster, and narrates Jessica entering the house. As the monster saw her in surprise, Erica stabbed it in the neck, and was pushed aside as Jessica fought the creature. Finally feeling safe, Erica hugged Octo, waiting for it to be over, only for Jessica to ask if the plush is hers and if she loves it. She told Erica to hand it to her, and then she can end this. Erica hugged Octo, gave him a kiss goodbye, and let him go. Speaking another language, Jessica then bound Octo into the plush. Now sitting in the white void of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Game of Nowhere (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2FtZV9vZl9Ob3doZXJlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Game of Nowhere</span>, Erica asks the monster if it feels sorry for killing her family. It says no, and she says that it's time to wake up. \n</p><p>Sitting up in the barn, Octo tells Erica that the others thought she was going to die, so they left her. Leaving the barn to see one of Gary's dogs, she responds, \"Yeah, well... I didn't. So what's next?\" \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Gary Slaughter</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Paris Slaughter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGFyaXNfU2xhdWdodGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Paris Slaughter</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Tybalt Slaughter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHliYWx0X1NsYXVnaHRlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Tybalt Slaughter</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Civilians\">Civilians</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Becca\" title=\"Becca\">Becca</a> †</li>\n<li>Erica's mother †</li>\n<li>Mark †</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">Monsters</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratypes</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"632416a083dc3010a6cda30cb82ea2f8\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"